parts.statement:
Using the A3 base map provided (template 1B-1), indicate the distribution and intensity of the use of the public spaces you observed in the fieldwork area.

- use appropriate cartographic techniques to produce your map;
- use the data from your field work (recording sheets and fieldwork map);
- give your map an appropriate title and provide a full descriptive map key (legend);
- annotate the map with comments on potential conflicts between different uses of public space and also between the uses of public space and the activities in the surrounding areas.
